    "body": [
      "The http://www.media.jaguar.com, http://www.media.landrover.com and http://www.media.jaguarlandrover.com websites (the \"Website\"), is operated by: Jaguar Land Rover Limited (with registered office at Abbey Road, Whitley, Coventry CV3 4LM and registered in England and Wales under number 01672070) (together \"Jaguar Land Rover\").",
